  "name": "Path to Ascension: purchasing, reforging and extracting Mystic Scrolls verify their tutorials",
  "contract": "Tutorial.dbc names Mystic Enchant tutorials whose objectives the altar performs. Mystic Extracts and Reforging (3, classes 0x7ff, excludes game modes 0x840) and its copy 275 (classes 0x5ff, no Hero; excludes 0x40; PTR realm) read 'Obtain an Untarnished Mystic Scroll', 'Reforge the Mystic Scroll 10 times' and 'Earn a Mystic Extract from Reforging'. Mystic Enchant Collection (4, 0x7ff, excludes 0x40) and its copy 276 (0x5ff) read 'Extract a Mystic Scroll to your Enchant Collection at an Altar.' Tutorial 11 (0x7ff, excludes 0x840) reads 'Save 3 Epic Enchants to your Enchant Collection', 12 'Save a Legendary Enchant', 26 'Extract 10 Mystic Enchants', 63 (classes 0xfffffa00: Hero and 12 up, not a Warrior) 'Obtain a Worldforged Mystic Scroll and Extract it to your Enchant Collection.' and Mystic Enchant Quality (273, 0x5ff, PTR realm) is read as every quality offered to the class being known. Expected: a Warrior and a Hero that buy a scroll and reforge it ten times verify 3 only on the tenth reforge; the Warrior also verifies 275 and the Hero does not. A Hero extracting verifies 4 but not 276, 11 on the third Epic, 12 on a Legendary, and 26 and 63 on a tenth extract that is Worldforged. A Warrior extracting verifies 4 and 276, 273 only once it knows Rare, Epic, Legendary and Artifact enchants, and never 63. A Wildcard Hero extracting does not verify 4.",
